@startuml
title Block Diagram Arsitektur Aplikasi

node "Client Browser" {
    [UI Web Streamlit] as WebUI
}

node "Local Web Server (Port 8501)" {
    [Streamlit Application Engine] as StreamlitEngine
    [Plotly & Wordcloud Rendering] as GraphEngine
}

node "Python Backend Execution" {
    [TF-IDF Feature Extractor] as Vectorizer
    [Naive Bayes Classifier] as ClassifierNB
    [SVM Classifier] as ClassifierSVM
}

database "File Storage System" {
    folder "Model Artifacts" {
        [nb_model.pkl] as fileNB
        [svm_model.pkl] as fileSVM
        [tfidf.pkl] as fileTFIDF
    }
    folder "Excel Database" {
        [data_twitter_terlabeli.xlsx] as fileExcel
    }
}

WebUI <--> StreamlitEngine : HTTP / WebSockets
StreamlitEngine --> GraphEngine : Request rendering
StreamlitEngine --> Vectorizer : Input text
Vectorizer --> fileTFIDF : Load
Vectorizer --> ClassifierNB : Feature vector
Vectorizer --> ClassifierSVM : Feature vector
ClassifierNB --> fileNB : Load
ClassifierSVM --> fileSVM : Load
StreamlitEngine --> fileExcel : Read data ringkasan

@endum
